    "research_question": "Can simultaneous feature selection and dataset trimming (outlier removal) via a $k$-means clustering algorithm based on Fisher's discriminant ratio improve the statistical significance and predictive power (e.g., $q^2$) of 3D-QSAR regression models (CoMFA/PLS) for a set of HIV-1 protease inhibitors?",
