      "Used Fisher's discriminant ratio ($C$) combined with a cross-correlation penalty term to rank and select features.",
      "Employed a $k$-means clustering algorithm ($k_{mm}=2$ or $3$) within each class for each selected descriptor to identify a 'bad cluster' containing smaller descriptor values (potential outliers).",
      "Trimmed/discarded inhibitors identified as outliers across all bad clusters for all selected descriptors.",
      "Evaluated the feature selection and dataset trimming using multiple linear regression, stepwise variable selection (MREG program), internal cross-validation ($q^2$), external validation metrics (Golbraikh and Tropsha), representation entropy ($H_R$), Shannon entropy, Cerius2 PLS regression, and SYBYL CoMFA PLS analysis."
